 "text": "Hi, how are things with you? Something fun and upbeat, but not too twirly. A modern pop or dance version of a classic ballroom song, like Cha-cha slide, might be perfect. Then go for something that feels a bit like the night you had. Maybe a jazzy upbeat dance tune, something that will keep the energy high. Sorry, I' gotten mixed up. The bar night is the classic dance song, maybe the Cha Cha Slide. Smaller bands can do live for much less. Around fifty to hundred pounds is about average. Then maybe a DJ with a few live musicians. They can play the kind of dance music you both like, and you can chat while it's going.",
